This directory is intentionally empty.

Model artifacts are excluded from Git because they are large binary files.
Run the following command to regenerate them:

    python scripts/train.py --stage all

Files that will appear here after training:
  - embeddings.pt          (FAISS embedding vectors)
  - faiss.index            (FAISS vector index)
  - filenames.pkl          (image filename mapping)
  - size_model.pt          (MLP fit model weights)
  - size_model_rf.pkl      (Random Forest fit model)
  - trend_model.pkl        (Prophet trend oracle)
  - pose_landmarker.task   (MediaPipe model — auto-downloaded on first API start)
